## Interface/Type Documentation

All interfaces and types must have:

1. **ALL CAPS title** describing the interface
2. **Brief description** of what it represents
3. **JSDoc @param tags** for each field
4. **Group Required vs Optional** fields with clear labels

```typescript
/**
 * JOB INTERFACE
 * 
 * Defines the data structure for a job record.
 * 
 * Required Fields:
 * @param {string} id - Unique identifier (format: JOB-XXX)
 * @param {string} lead - Customer/client name
 * @param {string} phone - Contact phone number
 * 
 * Optional Fields:
 * @param {string} description - Detailed job description/scope of work
 * @param {string} notes - Internal notes, special instructions
 */
export interface Job {
  id: string
  lead: string
  phone: string
  description?: string
  notes?: string
}
```

