## Inline Code Comments

Use single-line comments for clarification:

```typescript
// Generate ID: JOB-XXX where XXX is zero-padded number
id: `JOB-${String(jobs.length + 1).padStart(3, "0")}`

// Prepend new job to list (most recent first)
setJobs([job, ...jobs])

// In production: Implement actual date range logic
if (dateRange !== "all") {
  // TODO: Add date filtering
}
```

